deeper.body:
- axis 0 (size 1): which image in the batch;
- axis 1 (size 1): which box for that image (you could pass several);
- axis 2 (size 2): which corner (top-left, bottom-right);
- axis 3 (size 2): x and y.

Compare points on p.348: (1, 1, 2) = batch, number of points, (x, y). A box is in effect a pair of corner points, hence the extra axis. The interpretation of axis 1 as 'number of boxes' is our inference from the shape.
